"*copy/paste to global clipboard* shortcuts to :kbd:`Win` + :kbd:`c` for "
"copy, and :kbd:`Win` + :kbd:`v` for paste:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../user/how-to-guides/how-to-copy-and-paste-text.rst:70
#: 8a6b350de4654ad795d842cccf3b20f5
msgid ""
"For the changes to take effect in a qube, you need to restart the qube after "
"changing the shortcuts."
msgstr ""
